夹具只接在 COUT 后的 port。" (at 10.160000 21.844000 0) (effects (font (size 2.476500 2.476500)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 665dbb98-9803-5d05-82bd-84182b8b5ac9))(text "S05-11 | 2026-10-31 | 同名节点电气相连；实心点为连接；跨线无点不连接。" (at 10.160000 262.636000 0) (effects (font (size 2.311400 2.311400)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b00e3f06-00f8-505e-a9d6-93c7978b07f5))(text "CT1：30 pF + 2–18 pF；CT2：39 pF + 2–18 pF。" (at 20.320000 128.270000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid feacc43e-69df-5d1c-b849-31c2528e7e2c))(text "微调起点约 10.61 / 7.15 pF；需按受控加载调谐，不能由旋角定电容。" (at 20.320000 135.382000 0) (effects (font (size 2.476500 2.476500)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 310a64f1-589c-5226-90bf-4861e0443b8c))(text "tank1 / tank2 不设长测试柱：禁止直接挂普通 10 pF 探头验收。" (at 20.320000 142.494000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 88442a2b-0572-5560-8f34-cf3f9066da25))(text "可拆测量负载（不属于接收机）" (at 292.100000 47.244000 0) (effects (font (size 3.302000 3.302000)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 126ca0bb-7545-5c09-be41-7ccbd75b522e))(text "TP_PORT" (at 378.460000 72.390000 0) (effects (font (size 2.971800 2.971800)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 16d05e11-c335-53df-8940-ae56b521f6a9))(text "短接探头尖端" (at 378.460000 78.994000 0) (effects (font (size 2.311400 2.311400)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0b919b43-7dd7-50ea-ae31-2565c3ccdfab))(text "探头Rin计入并联电导；CEXT不能照抄固定值。" (at 292.100000 129.540000 0) (effects (font (size 2.476500 2.476500)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 240b44c7-605e-5627-8a28-955bb5c0997a))(text "原校核：953 Ω∥RPORT 1 MΩ∥接口1 MΩ；总14 pF。" (at 292.100000 136.398000 0) (effects (font (size 2.146300 2.146300)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid abad2ecd-0ad0-5eb6-855d-953ff95afa19))(text "1  信号源内部约50 Ω → 同轴芯线 → input；屏蔽层 → GND。源阻抗不是入口并联50 Ω。" (at 15.240000 165.100000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7bfd6635-f664-5632-9592-609a75031d37))(text "2  所有 tank 接点保持短小；不装长测试针、不接普通10 pF探头，也不直连示波器50 Ω。" (at 15.240000 173.736000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7e65c52f-2138-583f-a748-5e89d0ccdffe))(text "3  CEXT = 14 pF − 实际探头尖端电容 − 连接寄生；探头未知时，CEXT待定，暂不验收。" (at 15.240000 182.372000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fbcf5de9-288a-5bf3-bce0-956a1f389d3f))(text "4  普通10×探头仅在port负载预算与31 MHz传递校准满足条件后使用；DS2102E按探头手册选1 MΩ。" (at 15.240000 191.008000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5eb26d13-e52b-5242-a9e0-547cdfb85fb9))(text "5  接真实Q1时，拆除953 Ω、CEXT及测量探头/缓冲；保留RPORT，port接CIN1再到Q1基极。" (at 15.240000 199.644000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 96f42c5d-c469-5fe2-9404-12e2a84a1802))(text "6  两线圈轴向初始近似正交；几何间距不是互感合格证；固定工具/地铜位置后做加载扫频。" (at 15.240000 208.280000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2bfc426c-5949-548f-a65e-b6d2c58c4e5a))(text "7  独立port参考：中心31.030 MHz、BW1.885 MHz；工程带宽目标1.85–1.95 MHz，均非实测。" (at 15.240000 216.916000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f7681920-9d00-5a3f-82f3-0cbc8831a799))(text "8  CT1物理1=S→tank1、2=R→GND；CT2同理。S/R依厂家孔位图和实物确认，不按任意视角猜。" (at 15.240000 225.552000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f801d4ab-1fd3-57c6-bc1a-9ac19af1cd36))(text "9  原模型总CTUNE1=41.609801788 pF，CTUNE2=47.1490753446 pF；包含各1 pF布局寄生。" (at 15.240000 234.188000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4807aa31-f12d-55ff-8a73-816e22353da8))(text "10 不安装RLOSS、RCT、CSELF或CBOARD离散件；不能把寄生预算再焊成一个1 pF电容。" (at 15.240000 242.824000 0) (effects (font (size 2.641600 2.641600)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4a35c89f-a382-5784-882c-d77181c15143))(symbol (lib_id "S05:J_h") (at 15.240000 58.420000 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (uuid 9e28c1c1-315e-5f30-aafd-0b5330aaf261) (property "Reference" "JRF1" (at 15.240000 42.418000 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)))) (property "Value" "RF IN" (at 15.240000 47.244000 0) (effects (fon